UID:zRmhNQYB_RqYabFJk7TKz
SUMMARY:Houston Startup Speedrun
DTSTAMP:20260820T033112Z
DTSTART:20260820T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/wades-houston-start
	up-speedrun-at-the-ion-tickets-1988360089553?aff=erelexpmlt \nThe Houston 
	Startup Speedrun is an intensive and fast-paced program designed to provid
	e both early-stage founders and aspiring entrepreneurs with a comprehensiv
	e understanding of the Startup Founder’s Journey and the Houston startup e
	cosystem through a carefully curated curriculum consisting of 10 consecuti
	ve 50-minute sessions. Wade Pinder\, your host and facilitator\, is an exp
	erienced and trusted ecosystem guide for many Houston-based stakeholders. 
	With a focus on efficiency and accommodating the schedules of full-time wo
	rking professionals\, this program aims to quickly give you a “lay of the 
	land” while preparing you for your entrepreneurial journey.\n\nhttps://ion
	district.com/event/houston-startup-speedrun-7/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/houston-startup-speedrun-7/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT10H
END:VEVENT
