UID:PHy6gfnsiRer6zn8wbNgJ
SUMMARY:McGovern Centennial Gardens Volunteer Day
DTSTAMP:20260820T033112Z
DTSTART:20260826T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Wednesday for hands-on gardening projects at the 
	McGovern Centennial Gardens. From 8 a.m. to 11 a.m.\, come help with seaso
	nal tasks like planting\, weeding\, mulching\, and pruning. A great way to
	 connect with others and make a visible impact in the Park! \nNo experienc
