SUMMARY:Woodland Heights Architecture Walk
DTSTAMP:20260820T033113Z
DTSTART:20260913T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:Architecture Walks begin at 6 p.m. in June\, July\, August and 
	September.The William A. Wilson Realty Co. began developing Woodland Heigh
	ts in 1907 on 136 acres of land that was once part of John Austin's Mexica
	n land grant. The neighborhood was one of Houston's first "streetcar subur
	bs" — a streetcar line ran from downtown along Houston Avenue to just outs
	ide the Woodland Heights gates\, enabling working-class Houstonians to liv
	e in a lovely wooded setting and easily commute to their jobs.\n\nhttps://
	www.preservationhouston.org/calendar/2026/9/13/woodland-heights-architectu
	re-walk\n\nFrom Preservation Houston
URL:https://www.preservationhouston.org/calendar/2026/9/13/woodland-heights
	-architecture-walk
GEO:29.7589;-95.3677
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:preservation-houston
CATEGORIES:Preservation Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H30M
END:VEVENT
